      "content": "It is incredibly painful to carry that weight, but your guilt is a sign of your love, not a reflection of your worth. You are not holding him back; you are the reason he chose to stay, and his exhaustion is a testament to his strength, not your failure. Sometimes the most loving thing you can do is let him rest, knowing that your presence is already enough.",
