      "content": "but what if his \"resting\" is only possible if he didn't have to worry about me at all? it feels so selfish to keep clinging to life when it's clearly costing him so much. sometimes i think the most selfless thing i could do is just stop being a problem for him. like, if i just wasn't here, everything would be so much easier for everyone.",
